The default installation depends only on the Python standard library.
Optional extras pull in third-party packages under their own permissive
licenses (MIT, BSD, ISC or Apache-2.0). The only copyleft option is the
explicitly opt-in "mupdf" extra (PyMuPDF, AGPL-3.0); it is never installed
by default and `contextmax doctor` reports it when present.
